    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... the \"talk to someone\" talk. it's just so clinical. it doesn't change the fact that it feels like i'm just running on empty. like the code is corrupted. there's no \"fixing\" it, you know? you can't patch a fundamental error in the source code. it just feels like the whole thing is meant to be shut down. like it's just easier if the process is terminated.",
